# Both of these say "This is a generated file; do not edit or check into
# version control" in their own first line, and both were committed anyway.
# What they carried was the machine of whoever generated them -- an absolute
# FLUTTER_ROOT and FLUTTER_APPLICATION_PATH under a home directory and a
# project name that have nothing to do with this repo -- plus
# FLUTTER_BUILD_NAME=1.0.0 / FLUTTER_BUILD_NUMBER=1, four minor versions behind
# pubspec.yaml. flutter_tools rewrites both on every build, so nothing ever
# read the committed copies. They were pure noise.
Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh

# Regenerated by flutter_tools on every build, like the two above.
Flutter/ephemeral/
